   {:name samizdat.mutation/propose-cell!
    :summary "The safety around a cell edit: install, validate against every manifest, soak, commit a project version or roll back."}
   {:name samizdat.workflow/catalog
    :summary "Every workflow available to select or adapt, with its description."}
   {:name samizdat.workflow/compile-loop
    :summary "Compile a workflow definition through mycelium's static checks. Throws on any violation."}
   {:name samizdat.workflow/turn-manifest
